                        "entry_id": "2f45e0c2-0162-38e3-bf01-f7692b985b9b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The quality of being genial; friendly cheerfulness; warmth of disposition and manners."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e52bd1f5-96a3-4a30-993f-0241564f1b73",
                                "sense_id": "c0e57bf9-af7b-310a-8f82-6e6902d8e21d",
                                "text": "Sometimes this throat uttered Yes, sometimes it uttered No; sometimes it made inquiries about a time worn denizen of the place. Once it surprised her notions by remarking upon the friendliness and geniality written in the faces of the hills around."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f4060ec-ce30-4126-8470-4c8d25495395",
                                "sense_id": "c0e57bf9-af7b-310a-8f82-6e6902d8e21d",
                                "text": "[…] and yet there was such a wilful geniality about him, such a strenuous air of being off duty and forgetting his rank, that no one was ever quite at ease in his presence."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
